This is true for all punctuation, as well as keywords.],
  [Identifiers and numbers are a little bit different though.
The parser doesn’t particularly care about the actual string value of any identifier or number.
It only cares that an identifier or number was found.
However, if we think one level up, it’s quite likely that consumers of the parser will care what field name or number was in the GraphQL document.],
