More than a 2x speed improvement!],
  [Our starting lexer allocated over 20k objects, and when we finished we got it down to just 2 objects.
Of course the parser may ask the lexer to allocate something, but we know that we’re only allocating the bare minimum .
In fact, if the parser only records positional offsets, it could very well never ask the lexer to allocate anything!],
